<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Marcons yr attrib shr, div rises.</title>
<headline>Marcons yr attrib shr, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  15.7	  vs 14.6</p>
<p>    - pro-forma consolid  20.3	  vs 20.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 15.75	 vs 14.75</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.90	  vs 1.78</p>
<p>Div payable March 4</p>
<p>on register February 14</p>
<p>Full name: Marshalls Controlling Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company derives its income solely from its 69 percent investment in Marshalls Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
